# Phase 13: the ONLY Python packages in the production image (CPU inference service).
# Versions match the verified Windows environment for verdict parity. No torch, timm, transformers,
# CUDA, training or test dependencies. Locked with hashes for linux x86_64 / CPython 3.11 into
# docker/requirements-runtime.lock by:
#   uv pip compile docker/requirements-runtime.in --generate-hashes --python-version 3.11 \
#       --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --no-header -o docker/requirements-runtime.lock
